<title>GERMANY: TENNIS-STUTTGART CLAY-COURT RESULTS.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-STUTTGART CLAY-COURT RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>STUTTGART, Germany 1997-07-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results from the $1 million Stuttgart clay-court men's tournament on Saturday (prefix number denotes seeding):</p>
<p>Karol Kucera (Slovakia) beat 4-Sergi Bruguera (Spain) 6-3 2-6 7-5  </p>
<p>Albert Portas (Spain) beat 10-Felix Mantilla (Spain) 6-2 6-4</p>
<p>Semifinals will be played on Sunday.</p>
</text>
